.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH orbit-next 1  "next " 
.SH NAME
orbit\-next \- Show what to do next, with a reason for each item
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit next\fR [\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-wide\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show what to do next, with a reason for each item
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object per result, with `"v":1`, instead of text
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable ANSI colors
.TP
\fB\-\-wide\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  orbit next
  orbit next \-\-all
  orbit next \-\-wide
  orbit \-\-json next
